  "releaseNotes": "Adds version-aware TOON serialization and modern custom layouts.\n- Adds official TOON 4.0 through 4.4 and grouped custom 4.4 encoding and decoding\n- Adds automatic version detection and explicit enum-based version selection\n- Breaking: defaults encoding to official 4.4 and decoding to Auto; select CustomLegacy for previous wire behavior\n- Improves typed decoding allocations, cached property-key emission, and v4 stream buffer sizing\n- Fixes nested table detection, recursive CLR metadata, and Unicode validation edge cases",
